OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1791206754
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 10 Oct to Mon 19 OctFIt
OL,6,Fwill likely be quite changeable
OL,7,Fthrough the middle of October, as a
OL,8,Fseries of low pressure systems run
OL,9,Facross the North Atlantic, often to
OL,10,Fthe north and northwest of the UK,
OL,11,Fbringing occasional bands of rain and
OL,12,Fstrong winds, but interspersed with
OL,13,Fbrighter and more showery conditions.
OL,14,FRain will be most prevalent across
OL,15,Fhills in the west and especially
OL,16,Fnorthwest, where above average
OL,17,Frainfall is likely through this
OL,18,Fperiod. Longer drier interludes are
OL,19,Fmore favoured in sheltered southern
OL,20,Fand eastern parts, but even here it is
OL,21,Flikely to be wetter than during recent
OL,22,Fweeks. Whilst brief cooler interludes
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fare possible, temperatures are likely
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fto be a little above average in many
OL,25,Fareas for the period as a whole.
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
PN,16303
SC,0003
CT,20,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1791206754
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 19 Oct to Mon 2 Nov
OL,6,FLate October into early November will
OL,7,Fprobably maintain a changeable pattern
OL,8,Foverall with weather systems often
OL,9,Fmoving in from the Atlantic. These
OL,10,Fwill bring showers or longer spells of
OL,11,Frain at times, with the wettest and
OL,12,Fwindiest weather in the northwest,
OL,13,Fdrier in the southeast. There is a
OL,14,Fchance that a period of more widely
OL,15,Fdry conditions could develop for a
OL,16,Ftime, but confidence in the details of
OL,17,Fthis is low. Temperatures will
OL,18,Fprobably be above average overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
